            <div xml:id="m-ddb222f3-f03b-4099-9128-7db4ab500319">
              <lg xml:id="m-bf4fa954-2cbe-409b-b9e4-dc6998baa536">
                <l xml:id="m-be61812a-55a8-4305-8f18-b44e0287979c" facs="#m-c78810be-57a7-42fb-9c0d-0bd631841bdf" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-0d1debcb-91c1-4ae1-b9a8-d3153898e9c8" facs="#m-4d96dca3-55af-451f-a323-b4819ac7af31" label="ambiguous">ais</l><l xml:id="m-60fafe25-0682-4e29-8ad6-381f277cfbe1" facs="#m-04f52ee8-9afe-4b10-a9d3-5ada94eee2fd" label="text-like">AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-9fcf801c-8b3b-4567-a217-9d306165fb64" facs="#m-59070970-da72-428b-88af-93e9f88bf0c2" label="text-like">Antiphon : In illa die p. 823. Psalms of the Sunday p. 225.</l><l xml:id="m-6a464aed-158e-4b3c-890b-d8e25ee2d346" facs="#m-d9e8d17e-e3e3-428b-bc8d-f6659a1d72bd" label="text-like">The Short Resp. is sung in the tone Proper for the Time of Advent p. 280.</l><l xml:id="m-d59b1402-aa7d-41f4-bfd1-35c933ff0c53" facs="#m-906e4d47-405e-4af2-a122-3525a43002f6" label="lyrics-like">with the Y. Qui ventúrus es in mundum. from this Sunday until Christmas</l><l xml:id="m-fad3c6f2-a39b-4097-8037-3d6518651f6c" facs="#m-5f7a531d-a439-4f33-942c-8e5d43d51a7b" label="text-like">Eve, even in ihe Omce of the Saints, except on the Feast ot the Immaculate</l><l xml:id="m-397acf63-7252-49dc-923a-95e519a28669" facs="#m-60380dff-fcd0-4498-90ff-f319989e0964" label="text-like">Conception and during us Octave, when the Y. Qui natus es de Maria Virgine.</l><l xml:id="m-be8b5f8f-fabd-4ba9-802e-d4e68b2463bd" facs="#m-86d46356-cfd0-4529-96ef-44e8e9a022f8" label="lyrics-like">.280. However, on the Súndãr within the Octave, and on</l><l xml:id="m-81dc9a5c-d4a1-4678-beae-f4750cc3ec16" facs="#m-890092af-1164-4719-98a0-99b3849337f6" label="lyrics-like">the Ocave day itself if this should fall on a Sunday. the Y. Qui ventúrus es.</l><l xml:id="m-defdad44-ee60-4332-9e2b-69d786234d4d" facs="#m-f86645f4-4a89-4dee-a5f7-5bf50074df19" label="text-like">is said.</l><l xml:id="m-f67f7add-f4ff-45f6-9c84-b4ead37a212e" facs="#m-134af1bd-3d82-474a-87ed-e3d1dd0e5a89" label="lyrics-like">Then: Kyrie eléison. etc. as on p. 281.</l><l xml:id="m-e27ba546-f804-4547-8a5f-38faae76d393" facs="#m-8dc7a736-d16d-4ed3-9d51-61e88b3c1f87" label="lyrics-like">The Short Lesson Dómine miserére nóstri. p. 284 is said in the Office of the</l><l xml:id="m-d447ab53-461c-4123-9d56-be5a83e3708b" facs="#m-f961719a-ec54-47a3-b389-3e3a69646ea1" label="ambiguous">Season up to Christmas Eve exclusive.</l><l xml:id="m-53875c6e-ee1f-4c3e-96a3-57987f68d255" facs="#m-14874ca9-2f06-480d-a04a-1fd1a5d9b7e9" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-52140789-b309-47a7-8f2d-41af55eb5b35" facs="#m-2ba97440-1daf-4fb2-ac6d-5503c9bf630e" label="ambiguous">Hymn.=</l><l xml:id="m-219b4101-3809-44f2-8e02-9d8127487dea" facs="#m-0048f97d-0080-4528-a297-a72da575e5e7" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-759ce5c6-ac27-41b0-8b66-d9d926cdc1f1" facs="#m-36ddeff4-29fe-4114-97a1-093b71c71f73" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sancte nóbis Spí-ri-tus, Unum Pátri cum Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9dd6f14-8746-4c01-aec7-df53c23a5369" facs="#m-6cb3d2ae-3ae8-45f4-bd95-99202a4c2735" label="lyrics-like">li-o, Dignáre prómptus inge-ri, Nóstro refúsus péctori.</l><l xml:id="m-74024a9d-4446-4303-a0f5-ff53f73b4dfd" facs="#m-58081894-b1a0-43c6-857c-d2accc130309" label="lyrics-like">Os, língua, mens, sénsus, vigor, Praésta, Páter piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-dafef5f9-2cef-4f95-8096-2f0ed4af1ffb" facs="#m-6ed0cbf0-d400-48ed-bacc-f4df50cb0dfe" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-d4f33b75-d7a1-48e9-88f8-dc148592af51" facs="#m-0c4dbfde-5789-4d91-a6ff-0fb481d443a1" label="lyrics-like">Confessiônem pérsonent:</l><l xml:id="m-653f8093-ea8f-45a1-a4d6-cbf6334991a3" facs="#m-48c1885c-6f6c-494f-9a55-36b3a79bf966" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-fe42039e-4dc2-4bf8-af67-497e4b6630c8" facs="#m-c36b0c41-0a3f-4678-b836-c11d6f3778e8" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat igne cáritas,</l><l xml:id="m-02267443-446e-491f-84d0-663671592166" facs="#m-29418bca-f38f-4717-a71e-de6fd60669b1" label="lyrics-like">Accéndat árdõr próximos.</l><l xml:id="m-4a48ea5d-38e5-4aac-b018-f9109b99253e" facs="#m-c31f040b-ec79-43e3-b17d-5240781f8d51" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-794e2961-0d49-4f10-bd3d-f6e9cc31a021" facs="#m-74a5552b-1561-4cd9-a821-1a60982f14e5" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-579c28d2-17d5-472a-a924-9532e4b0a96d" facs="#m-097737c4-e53a-4437-8153-1f62e2818609" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Jucundáre. p. 323. Chapter of Vespers, Fratres: Hora est. p. 324.</l><l xml:id="m-74087789-a524-4b54-8e5c-876b875762fa" facs="#m-31d71e92-853f-458b-aa1f-3d042cb07c43" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Véni ad liberándum nos. p. 238. V. Timébunt géntes.</l><l xml:id="m-a096320e-ae78-4294-b767-348bafa68b5d" facs="#m-330ec6ab-8291-42be-9ee4-bf407e692019" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-8de04b7a-c556-42bf-93c1-33cca240f490" facs="#m-088892c7-c6b9-4107-83b9-3e65be960f48" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-612a019f-b160-465d-9ab3-b72fe67d1218" facs="#m-ec1e4151-e1ea-40ea-88cc-ba01fef5b0bc" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-84426250-d304-4391-bbef-cb7b993fe6c6" facs="#m-0e14e387-78cf-45c8-a176-b2b598168921" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-41fc1436-ca72-448a-99b1-d7aa131678aa" facs="#m-22829a9f-e1a8-4071-a286-02b847bd967b" label="lyrics-like">D te levávi “ á-nimam mé-am: Dé-us mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ae1622d-8fe8-43f1-8e47-db76f11ed685" facs="#m-31cd1105-3730-4a3f-8736-9c3d2fbb6938" label="ambiguous">us</l><l xml:id="m-b4ff2cb9-0fdb-44cc-8359-9e645e143ceb" facs="#m-ec3ebb18-2de4-44cd-8992-c04ab83cfc4c" label="lyrics-like">irrí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac4a5fbb-530a-4239-9f4d-9a9155397026" facs="#m-0bdb8042-4232-4243-b484-621cc42459b4" label="lyrics-like">in te confí-do, non e-ru- bé-scam: neque</l><l xml:id="m-464f065c-c1b6-4463-af82-6925250ac1b7" facs="#m-9b42135e-4bd7-448a-af69-7ab415981c9d" label="lyrics-like">inimí-ci mé¬: ét-e-nim univér-si qui</l><l xml:id="m-d9f52a6c-14c7-4fa1-aa94-eec6846b37d9" facs="#m-7edc8aa6-9b95-4a35-a68d-38165963eb4e" label="ambiguous">de- ant me</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
